#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/index.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Create: Factory Controller provides a block called the \"`factory "
"controller`\", which allows you to place factory gauges and other components "
"on a virtual board stored inside the block. Factory gauges placed in factory "
"controllers also receive many functional enhancements."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/index.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You do not need to read this manual in full to use the mod. The manual "
"serves to provide a reference to the features of the mod, especially to "
"those that are difficult to explain fully in the UI."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/index.adoc:10
msgid ""
"This manual corresponds to version {mod-version} of the mod. Information may "
"be incorrect for other versions."
msgstr ""

